        "evidence": "Pinned Windows resource tests show standalone surfaces start at one public reference and retain one device reference; texture levels share parent counts. This is supporting creation/containment context, not a new original-HAL binding run."
      },
      {
        "file": "d3d8-container-surface.c",
        "sha256": "94409282de3533f8ddfe4392c04568346d090bb5f39f1bb33fef910613e13f89",
